WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:08.890
In this lesson, you will learn to change how a character looks with grow, shrink, hide and show blocks to tell a story.

2
00:00:08.890 --> 00:00:12.080
The grow block makes a character bigger.

3
00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:14.730
Use it twice to grow even more.

4
00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:19.150
Shrink makes a character smaller — like Alice in Wonderland!

5
00:00:19.150 --> 00:00:24.470
Hide makes a character disappear.

6
00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:26.820
It’s still there, just invisible.

7
00:00:26.820 --> 00:00:28.840
Show makes it appear again.

8
00:00:28.840 --> 00:00:32.490
Great for surprises!

9
00:00:32.490 --> 00:00:35.110
The bug eats 2 leaves (gems). After each leaf, it grows.

10
00:00:35.110 --> 00:00:39.230
Munch, grow, munch, grow — what a big bug!

11
00:00:39.230 --> 00:00:43.190
Great work! Let’s remember what we learned.

12
00:00:43.190 --> 00:00:47.790
Now build along, then try the challenges. You’ve got this!
